'''Karma''' is an [[Enchantment]] that grants {{Green|+1-6%}} chance for [[Tree Gifts]] to contain double the loot when applied to [[Axe]]s.

== Obtaining ==
The {{Ench|Karma}} [[Enchantment]] can be obtained in various ways:
{| class="wikitable ct"
|-
! Enchantment Tier !! Enchantment Source
|-
| {{Ench|Karma I}} || {{Green|0.2%}} chance to drop from [[Helix Tree Gift]]s
|-
| {{Ench|Karma VI}}<br>{{Item|Forest's Favor}} [[Endcap Upgrade]] || {{Green|0.02%}} chance to drop from [[Helix Tree Gift]]s
|}

{{Item|Enchanted Book|enchant=Karma}} can be combined on an {{Item|Anvil}} up to {{Ench|Karma V}}.

=== Bazaar ===
{{Ench|Karma}} can be traded through the [[Bazaar]].
{{EnchantmentBazaarStats|id=ENCHANTMENT_KARMA|name=Karma|minimum=1|maximum=5}}

== Ability ==
Items applied with {{Ench|Karma}} gain {{Green|+1-6%}} chance for [[Tree Gifts]] to contain double the loot at their respective levels.

{| class = "wikitable ct"
! Tier !! Double [[Tree Gift]] chance
|-
|{{Romnum|I}} ||{{Green|+1%}}
|-
|{{Romnum|II}} ||{{Green|+2%}}
|-
|{{Romnum|III}} ||{{Green|+3%}}
|-
|{{Romnum|IV}} ||{{Green|+4%}}
|-
|{{Romnum|V}} ||{{Green|+5%}}
|-
|{{Romnum|VI}} ||{{Green|+6%}}
|}

Upon activating, '''Karma''' sends the following message in chat:

{{Dialogue|&d&lKARMA! &fYour &2Tree Gift &fcontained doubled loot!}}

== Applying ==
{{Ench|Karma}} can be applied to [[Axe]]s.

